      "zIndex": 1,
      "text": "PHASE 1: RUST SERVER CORE\n\n• WASAPI Loopback Capture (Untouched)\n• Downmix: Mono/Stereo/5.1/7.1 -> 2ch\n• FIFO Buffer + rubato Stateful Resampler\n• 16-byte Packet Framing (Magic/Seq/Ts)\n• Ping/Pong Keep-Alive (5s interval)",
