      "zIndex": 2,
      "text": "PHASE 2: BROWSER REFERENCE\n\n• Web Audio AudioWorklet Pipeline\n• 16-byte Header Unpacker & Sequence Check\n• Lock-Free Ring Buffer (100-150ms)\n• WebSocket Auto-Reconnect (Backoff)\n• Telemetry: Drops, Buffer Depth, Jitter",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": "Inter, sans-serif",
