      "text": "PHASE 3 & 4: ANDROID NATIVE APK\n\n• Jetpack Compose UI (Telemetry & Controls)\n• Foreground Service (mediaPlayback)\n• MediaSessionCompat & Lockscreen Notif\n• OkHttp WebSocket + Auto Reconnect\n• Ring Jitter Buffer + AudioTrack (STREAM)",
